l/2.2.1","body":"### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fix an issue where `poetry self show` failed with a message about an invalid output format ([#10560](https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/pull/10560)).\r\n\r\n### Docs\r\n\r\n- Remove outdated statements about dependency groups ([#10561](https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/pull/10561)).\r\n\r\n### poetry-core ([`2.2.1`](https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry-core/releases/tag/2.2.1))\r\n\r\n- Fix an issue where it was not possible to declare a PEP 735 dependency group as optional ([#888](https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry-core/pull/888)).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/releases/248865241/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/releases/247078587","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/releases/247078587/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/releases/247078587/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/releases/tag/2.2.0","id":247078587,"author":{"login":"radoering","id":30527984,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTI3OTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30527984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering","html_url":"https://github.com/radoering","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radoering/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https